      {
        "h3": { "en": "Each idler stack is 18 mm", "zh": "惰轮组高度统一 18 mm" },
        "body": { "en": "Idler 8.5 mm, spacer 9 mm, shim 0.5 mm. Use shims and spacers to bring every idler stack to a uniform 18 mm.", "zh": "惰轮高 8.5 mm、轴套高 9 mm、垫片厚 0.5 mm。用垫片和轴套把每个惰轮组统一调到 18 mm。" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:105mm; top:40mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": { "en": "Spacer must total 9 mm", "zh": "轴套总高应为 9 mm" },
        "body": { "en": "The spacer is 9 mm tall. If you can't buy that exact height, stack shorter spacers to total 9 mm.", "zh": "轴套高 9 mm。如果买不到这个高度，用几个较短的轴套叠加到 9 mm。" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:110mm; top:82mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
